      "widgets_values": [
        "Three FastH3 clips with sound, one segment node each. The second is a shot, so it continues from the first clip's last frame; the third is a cut, so it opens fresh. Each prompt describes the scene and its sound again, since a clip remembers nothing of the one before.\n\nFastH3 prompt guide: https://docs.reactor.inc/model-api-reference/fast-h3/prompt-guide\n\nSet your Reactor API key in this plugin's config.ini."
      ],
